==English==
===Verb===
'''[[have]] an [[axe]] [[to]] [[grind]]'''
#{{idiom}} To have a [[dispute]], [[resentment]] or [[grudge]]; to take [[issue]] with something.  Sometimes with a disposition to act on that resentment covertly.
#:''Take it easy when you meet with him this afternoon, since they '''have an axe to grind''' about the last visit.''